    "name": "Crowded Mysteries",
    "steam_appid": 2528980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528980/extras/b4f5c43205035c665e4a9ee803d1e4e8.poster.avif?t=1709285411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528980/extras/b4f5c43205035c665e4a9ee803d1e4e8.webm?t=1709285411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528980/extras/b4f5c43205035c665e4a9ee803d1e4e8.mp4?t=1709285411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME TO SOLVE CRIME!</strong></h2><br>You're Mystery City's greatest... well, <i>almost only</i> detective. <br>Your job is to investigate the crimes that plague the city, so that your moustached detective-cop partner can interrogate suspects. <br><br>(And oh dear, there's a lot of crimes and suspects....)<br><br>Look for clues - some obvious, some strange, some unfairly hidden away...<br>What, did you think it's always a fair deal for a detective? As if criminals would leave their tracks exposed? Ha!<br>Lucky for you, you've got 4D vision... Across time and space.... (maybe that's why you're an invaluable detective!)<br><br>If you're fast, gain stars. If you take your time... well, don't? It's not like you need them. But they're oooh so shiny...<br><br>Anyway, don't waste time for chitchat. Put on your detective hat and solve some crimes!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528980/extras/b4f5c43205035c665e4a9ee803d1e4e8.poster.avif?t=1709285411\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528980/extras/b4f5c43205035c665e4a9ee803d1e4e8.webm?t=1709285411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528980/extras/b4f5c43205035c665e4a9ee803d1e4e8.mp4?t=1709285411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME TO SOLVE CRIME!</strong></h2><br>You're Mystery City's greatest... well, <i>almost only</i> detective. <br>Your job is to investigate the crimes that plague the city, so that your moustached detective-cop partner can interrogate suspects. <br><br>(And oh dear, there's a lot of crimes and suspects....)<br><br>Look for clues - some obvious, some strange, some unfairly hidden away...<br>What, did you think it's always a fair deal for a detective? As if criminals would leave their tracks exposed? Ha!<br>Lucky for you, you've got 4D vision... Across time and space.... (maybe that's why you're an invaluable detective!)<br><br>If you're fast, gain stars. If you take your time... well, don't? It's not like you need them. But they're oooh so shiny...<br><br>Anyway, don't waste time for chitchat. Put on your detective hat and solve some crimes!",
    "short_description": "There's a lot of trouble and intrigue in Mystery City... And where there's trouble and intrigue, there has to be a detective capable of tracking down the most elusive of wrongdoers. That's you! You're the detective, I mean. Go and solve some crimes, point-and-click analogue puzzle style!",
